   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2077581031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 582990049,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why R\u207b\u00b9 = R^T (free inverse!)",
   "originalText": "Why R\u207b\u00b9 = R^T (free inverse!)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b0u"
  },
  {
   "id": "t58",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1313,
   "y": 490,
   "width": 297.0,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "f34",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1658274118,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 785239051,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The columns have length 1 and are\nperpendicular (x\u0302\u00b7\u0177 = 0, x\u0302\u00b7x\u0302 = 1).\nSo R^T \u00b7 R = I.\n\nEach row of R^T is a dot product:\n  px^B = x\u0302_B \u00b7 v,   py^B = \u0177_B \u00b7 v",
   "originalText": "The columns have length 1 and are\nperpendicular (x\u0302\u00b7\u0177 = 0, x\u0302\u00b7x\u0302 = 1).\nSo R^T \u00b7 R = I.\n\nEach row of R^T is a dot product:\n  px^B = x\u0302_B \u00b7 v,   py^B = \u0177_B \u00b7 v",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b0v"
  },
  {
   "id": "t59",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 910,
   "y": 635,
   "width": 646.8000000000001,
   "height": 17.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "f34",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 662006162,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1334924301,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Never memorize signs \u2014 just ask \"where do +X, +Y, +Z go?\" and write them as columns.",
   "originalText": "Never memorize signs \u2014 just ask \"where do +X, +Y, +Z go?\" and write them as columns.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b0w"
  },
