   "text": "v = (dx\u00b7cos(yaw) + dy\u00b7sin(yaw)) / dt    // project world velocity onto body +X\nw = wrap_angle(yaw \u2212 yaw_prev) / dt     // shortest angular diff in (\u2212\u03c0, \u03c0]",
